# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment variables — never committed (see CLAUDE.md).
# Note VITE_-prefixed values are baked into the public bundle, so they are
# not secret; this protects anything else that ends up in these files.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Vitest coverage output
coverage

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# amplify
.amplify
amplify_outputs*
amplifyconfiguration*

# Claude — agent definitions and project instructions are committed, so the
# repo shows how the project is built. Only the per-machine permissions file
# is kept local: it records absolute paths from one developer's disk.
.claude/settings.local.json

# HANDOFF.md is a local resume-note file, edited directly on main (see CLAUDE.md).
# Kept out of the repo so updating it doesn't trigger a build/deploy.
HANDOFF.md
